// A *syntactically incomplete* statement that runs off the end of input is E0004. (A merely
// missing trailing `;` is no longer an error — object-model slice 7 makes a line end / EOF
// terminate a statement — so the incompleteness here is the dangling `+` with no right operand.)
// expect: error E0004 at 6:8
// expect: exit 1
x = 1 +
